        "code": "module TopModule (\n  input [4:1] x,\n  output reg f\n);\n\n  always @(*) begin\n    case (x)\n      4'h0, 4'h1, 4'h2, 4'h3: f = 1'b0;\n      4'h4: f = 1'b1;\n      4'h5: f = 1'b0;\n      4'h6: f = 1'b1;\n      4'h7: f = 1'b0;\n      4'hc, 4'hd, 4'he: f = 1'b1;\n      4'hf: f = 1'b0;\n      // 8..b are don't-care: left out\n    endcase\n  end\n\nendmodule\n"
      },
      "vbest": {
        "version": 4,
        "official_pass": true,
        "code": "module TopModule (\n  input [4:1] x,\n  output reg f\n);\n\n  always @(*) begin\n    f = 1'b0;  // every output assigned on every path\n    case (x)\n      4'h4, 4'h6, 4'hc, 4'hd, 4'he: f = 1'b1;\n      default: f = 1'b0;\n    endcase\n  end\n\nendmodule\n"
      },
      "explanation": {
        "round": 6,
        "summary": "Every case statement gets a default branch that assigns every output",
